msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Nexus source documentation\nLanguage: zh_CN\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nX-Nexus-Reviewed: true\nX-Nexus-Source-SHA256: d6fced09072cbbcf9a35fc63f932b36f01060e90c5753381d9cce097fd8f573a\n"

msgid "Kernel-invoked user I/O admission"
msgstr "内核调用的用户 I/O 准入"

msgid "The optional `Nexus::UserIoBroker` separates untrusted messages from trusted kernel policy. The scalar GPIO path pins user memory for one bounded typed read or set/reset write. A separate copied UART TX path retains only privileged request/payload cells and uses the existing BusOwner/UARTOwner. Neither path accepts a user-supplied principal, port, MMIO address, callback or private slot pointer. Actual kernel entry, permissions and hardware attribution remain integration responsibilities."
msgstr "可选 `Nexus::UserIoBroker` 将不可信消息与可信内核策略分离。标量 GPIO 路径为一次有界类型化读取或 set/reset 写入 pin 用户内存。独立的复制 UART TX 路径只保留特权 request/payload cell，并使用既有 BusOwner/UARTOwner。两条路径都不接受用户提供的 principal、port、MMIO 地址、callback 或私有 slot 指针。实际内核入口、权限和硬件归属仍由集成方负责。"

msgid "Scalar GPIO and pinned user memory"
msgstr "标量 GPIO 与 pinned 用户内存"

msgid "The 32-byte input and 8-byte output contain explicit `uint32_t` fields. The trusted gateway calls the public API from privileged Thread mode with incoming interrupt masks clear. A kernel identity callback authenticates the current principal; the public message cannot choose it. Construction retains immutable nonoverlapping nominal user RAM windows, exact device/mask grants, a positive loan capacity and the kernel memory port. All known broker, policy, port-table and private context spans stay outside those user windows."
msgstr "32 字节输入与 8 字节输出包含显式 `uint32_t` 字段。可信 gateway 在特权 Thread、进入时中断掩码全清的上下文调用公共 API。内核身份回调认证当前主体，公共消息不能选择它。构造保留不可变且互不重叠的名义用户 RAM 窗口、精确器件／位掩码授权、正数借用容量和内核内存端口。全部已知 broker、策略、端口表与私有 context 范围位于用户窗口之外。"

msgid "Admission validates full-span arithmetic, alignment, access and one-window containment before pinning. `pin` must establish the specified CPU access and retain address-space/process/mapping lifetime until successful `unpin`. A failed pin must leave no mapping references or residual effects. The whitelist alone does not establish actual mapped RAM, DMA reachability, MMIO exclusion or MPU isolation; the trusted kernel and SoC memory layout establish those facts."
msgstr "准入在 pin 前校验完整跨度运算、对齐、访问权限与单窗口包含关系。`pin` 必须建立指定 CPU 访问能力，并保留地址空间／进程／映射生命周期，直到 `unpin` 成功。pin 失败不能残留映射引用或效果。白名单自身不能证明实际映射 RAM、DMA 可达性、MMIO 排除或 MPU 隔离；可信内核与 SoC 内存布局负责建立这些事实。"

msgid "The input is pinned and copied once into kernel storage. Policy checks use that snapshot. The reply span is pinned before any GPIO operation. A final saved-mask guard serializes revocation with the bounded scalar provider operation. Close before this guard prohibits the effect; close after dispatch cannot undo it. Every dispatched result copies a fully initialized reply, including provider errors. A cancelled admission leaves the reply untouched. Pins remain held through all copies."
msgstr "输入被 pin 后只复制一次到内核存储，策略使用该快照。任何 GPIO 操作前先 pin 回复范围。最终保存掩码的 guard 将撤销与有界标量提供者操作串行化；进入 guard 前 close 禁止效果，dispatch 后 close 不能撤销效果。每个 dispatch 结果都复制完全初始化的回复，包括提供者错误；取消准入不修改回复。全部复制期间持续保留 pin。"

msgid "`result` reports admission/device execution and `cleanup_result` reports the most recent release attempt. `accepted` becomes true at the first successful pin. `device_effect_possible` is set before calling the WRITE provider, even if that provider returns an error. `retained` requires the exact kernel call slot, user memory and address-space identity to stay alive. Cleanup tries output then input release, records errors and preserves every failed pin independently. `gpio_finish` retries only retained cleanup; it never rereads users, writes a reply or repeats a device operation. Neither an operation error nor successful cleanup authorizes replay of an earlier write."
msgstr "`result` 报告准入／器件执行，`cleanup_result` 报告最近释放尝试。首次 pin 成功时 `accepted` 变为 true。WRITE 提供者调用前设置 `device_effect_possible`，即使提供者随后返回错误。`retained` 要求精确内核调用槽、用户内存及地址空间身份保持存活。清理先尝试输出再尝试输入释放，记录错误并独立保留每个失败 pin。`gpio_finish` 仅重试保留清理，绝不重新读取用户、写回复或重复器件操作。操作错误或清理成功都不能授权重放先前写入。"

msgid "The private generic loan mechanism retains one exact slot pointer with a monotonic 64-bit epoch. Copied tokens and stale epochs cannot release it; epoch exhaustion rejects reuse. Read-only spans may share bytes; any writable overlap with a peer loan rejects. Known policy, provider, other loan and drain-control aliases reject before mutation. Only the two exact internal GPIO child slots may share their own call proof. A trusted drain callback must prove actual peripheral/DMA/IRQ/deferred/copy final access and observer join. User input cannot claim this proof. A failed proof or unpin keeps the exact pin and token retained."
msgstr "私有通用借用机制保留精确槽指针与单调 64 位 epoch。复制 token 与旧 epoch 不能释放它；epoch 耗尽拒绝复用。只读范围可共享字节，任何可写范围与对等借用重叠均拒绝。已知策略、提供者、其他借用和排空控制别名均在修改前拒绝。只有两个精确内部 GPIO 子槽可以共享自身调用证明。可信排空回调须证明实际外设／DMA／IRQ／延后执行／复制的最终访问及观察者 join；用户输入不能声明此证明。证明或 unpin 失败保留精确 pin 与 token。"

msgid "One privileged serialized kernel owner controls a broker and its slots. All memory/proof callbacks are bounded and run outside Arch guards; they may mark close, but cannot recursively admit, release, execute or retain the cookie output. Close inhibits admission and preserves every live loan. Quiescence is valid only after close, with zero loans/list entries and no executor. It does not implicitly stop providers or establish an application shutdown barrier. There is no reopen or hidden identity registry. NMI/fault/SMP publishers and unserialized privileged memory writers are outside this contract."
msgstr "唯一特权串行内核所有者控制 broker 及其槽。全部内存／证明回调有界且在 Arch guard 外执行，可以标记 close，但不能递归准入、释放、执行或保留 cookie 输出。Close 禁止准入且保留全部活动借用。只有 close 后、借用／列表条目为零且无执行者，静止证明才有效。它不隐式停止提供者，也不建立应用停机屏障。没有 reopen 或隐藏身份注册表。NMI／fault／SMP 发布者和非串行特权内存写入者不在本合同内。"

msgid "This is a component callable by an integrating privileged kernel, not an implemented userspace transport. FreeRTOS SVC/MPU wrappers, task principal authentication, real memory pins, fault-safe copy mechanisms and TrustZone veneers are not connected in this slice. Generic loans provide ownership mechanics. They do not provide asynchronous borrowed-user UART/SPI/CAN messages. The copied UART path below is a separate contract and accepts no user-supplied drain proof."
msgstr "这是可由集成特权内核调用的组件，不是已实现的用户空间 transport。本切片未接入 FreeRTOS SVC／MPU 包装、任务主体认证、真实内存 pin、fault-safe 复制或 TrustZone veneer。通用借用提供所有权机制，不提供异步借用用户内存的 UART／SPI／CAN 消息。下文复制 UART 路径使用独立合同，不接受用户提供的排空证明。"

msgid "Copied asynchronous UART TX"
msgstr "复制式异步 UART TX"

msgid "The [public protocol](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/user_io_broker/include/nexus/components/user_io_async.h) and [trusted construction](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/user_io_broker/include/nexus/components/user_io_async_storage.h) provide `construct`, `dispatch`, `close`, `reap` and `join`. The optional target does not create a factory, kernel task, queue, registry or lock. The caller supplies exact privileged cells and payload capacities, immutable policy/user windows, complete private-context extents and an already constructed exclusive BusOwner/UARTOwner/UART binding. The existing BusOwner remains the only FIFO."
msgstr "[公共协议](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/user_io_broker/include/nexus/components/user_io_async.h)与[可信构造](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/user_io_broker/include/nexus/components/user_io_async_storage.h)提供 `construct`、`dispatch`、`close`、`reap` 和 `join`。可选目标不创建 factory、内核 task、queue、registry 或 lock。调用方提供精确特权 cell 与 payload 容量、不可变策略／用户窗口、完整私有 context 范围，以及已构造的独占 BusOwner/UARTOwner/UART 绑定。既有 BusOwner 仍是唯一 FIFO。"

msgid "![FIG-25: current copied-UART TX ownership; labeled arrows distinguish user copies, existing owner execution and required trusted lifecycle proofs](../assets/diagrams/user-io-copied-ownership.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-25：当前 UART TX 复制代理所有权；标注箭头区分用户复制、既有 owner 执行与必需的可信生命周期证明](../assets/diagrams/user-io-copied-ownership.svg)"

msgid "FIG-25: current copied-UART TX ownership; labeled arrows distinguish user copies, existing owner execution and required trusted lifecycle proofs"
msgstr "FIG-25：当前 UART TX 复制代理所有权；标注箭头区分用户复制、既有 owner 执行与必需的可信生命周期证明"

msgid "FIG-25 describes the current software mechanism, not an installed kernel gateway or physical isolation result. The trusted kernel supplies principal identity, fault-contained copies and an exclusive session/role authority. The external executor advances the existing owner; no gateway call services UART implicitly. The [implementation](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/user_io_broker/src/user_io_async.c), [BusOwner](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/bus_owner/include/nexus/components/bus_owner.h) and [UARTOwner](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/bus_owner/include/nexus/components/uart_owner.h) define the figure's source and final-access boundaries."
msgstr "FIG-25 描述当前软件机制，不表示已安装内核 gateway 或物理隔离结果。可信内核提供 principal 身份、容错复制和独占 session/role authority。外部 executor 推进既有 owner；任何 gateway 调用都不隐式 service UART。[实现](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/user_io_broker/src/user_io_async.c)、[BusOwner](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/bus_owner/include/nexus/components/bus_owner.h) 和 [UARTOwner](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/bus_owner/include/nexus/components/uart_owner.h)定义本图的源码及最后访问边界。"

msgid "Construction checks all complete span arithmetic and known aliases before any external callback or claim. Cells, payloads, configuration, region/operation tables, owner slots, UART executor/provider and every declared context stay outside nominal user windows and disjoint as required. A temporary construction reservation blocks callback reentry. The final trusted claim establishes one exclusive role for the actual controller/owner, then initialization has no fallible step. Another wrapper of that controller is not another role."
msgstr "构造在任何外部回调或 claim 前检查全部完整跨度运算及已知别名。Cell、payload、配置、region/operation 表、owner slot、UART executor/provider 和每个已声明 context 均位于名义用户窗口之外，并按要求互不重叠。临时构造 reservation 阻止回调重入。最终可信 claim 为实际 controller/owner 建立唯一独占 role，此后初始化不再有可失败步骤。同一 controller 的另一个 wrapper 不构成另一个 role。"

msgid "The authority must retain nonwrapping session history across fresh server storage, process/device reset and reconstruction. It rejects reused or non-increasing nonzero sessions and any second live role, including a larger session, and fails closed when history is exhausted. The component supplies no persistence policy or authority implementation. Initialize-once alone is insufficient: after successful join, fresh objects need a larger claimed session so old commands cannot become valid in new storage."
msgstr "Authority 必须跨新 server 存储、进程／器件复位和重建保留不回绕的 session 历史。它拒绝复用或不递增的非零 session，以及任何第二个活动 role（即使 session 更大），并在历史耗尽时关闭接纳。组件不提供持久化策略或 authority 实现。仅 initialize-once 不足以满足要求：成功 join 后，新对象需要更大的已 claim session，使旧命令不能在新存储中重新有效。"

msgid "Every admitted gateway transaction authenticates the current principal before copying users. A 48 B scalar header names device, session, slot, epoch, length and an absolute deadline in the existing owner's clock domain. A 40 B initialized reply contains no privileged pointer. These are local C gateway records; the integrating kernel owns any transport serialization. The copied header is checked once; full read/write containment and disjoint user spans precede payload/reply copies. The trusted copy port must establish real permission, fault containment and mapping/process lifetime for each callback; nominal ranges alone establish none of these properties. No user address survives return."
msgstr "每次已接纳 gateway 事务都在复制用户数据前认证当前 principal。48 B 标量 header 包含 device、session、slot、epoch、length，以及既有 owner 时钟域中的绝对 deadline。40 B 完全初始化的 reply 不包含特权指针。它们是本地 C gateway 记录；任何 transport 序列化均由集成内核负责。复制的 header 只检查一次；完整读写范围包含关系和互不重叠的用户跨度检查先于 payload/reply 复制。可信 copy port 必须为每次回调建立真实权限、容错与 mapping/process 生命周期；名义范围本身不能建立这些属性。返回后不保留任何用户地址。"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

msgid "Ownership and result"
msgstr "所有权与结果"

msgid "`SUBMIT`"
msgstr "`SUBMIT`"

msgid "Propose the exact next nonzero slot epoch in the claimed session; copy a positive bounded payload before owner admission. Copy failure wipes the copied payload without burning the epoch. Acceptance reserves the copied cell, including a retained terminal error if BusOwner rejects."
msgstr "在已 claim session 中提出精确下一个非零 slot epoch；在 owner 接纳前复制正数且有界的 payload。复制失败擦除已复制 payload，不消耗 epoch。接受会保留复制 cell，包括 BusOwner 拒绝时的保留 terminal 错误。"

msgid "`POLL`"
msgstr "`POLL`"

msgid "Use the exact accepted session/slot/epoch. Only acquire-observed `SETTLED` exposes final result/count; earlier replies report `BUSY` and zero count."
msgstr "使用精确已接受 session/slot/epoch。只有以 acquire 观察 `SETTLED` 才暴露最终 result/count；更早 reply 报告 `BUSY` 且 count 为零。"

msgid "`CANCEL`"
msgstr "`CANCEL`"

msgid "Request the real owner's withdrawal. Cancellation, timeout and quarantine retain cells; late cancellation cannot replace the provider's observed terminal result."
msgstr "请求真实 owner 撤回。取消、超时和隔离保留 cell；晚到取消不能覆盖 provider 已观察到的 terminal 结果。"

msgid "`CONSUME`"
msgstr "`CONSUME`"

msgid "Require acquire-observed `SETTLED` and real BusOwner idle/publication join. Copy the reply first; only success releases the exact identity and wipes copied bytes."
msgstr "要求以 acquire 观察 `SETTLED`，且真实 BusOwner 已 idle／完成发布 join。先复制 reply；只有成功才释放精确身份并擦除已复制字节。"

msgid "A reply-copy error can follow accepted `SUBMIT`. The user already knows its proposed session/slot/epoch and must recover with `POLL`; duplicate `SUBMIT` cannot replay or replace the operation. A failed `CONSUME` reply copy retains the terminal cell. Accepted TX may already have irreversible effects; no error authorizes automatic replay. Per-slot epochs never wrap and survive consumption."
msgstr "已接受 `SUBMIT` 后仍可能发生 reply 复制错误。用户已知其提出的 session/slot/epoch，必须以 `POLL` 恢复；重复 `SUBMIT` 不能重放或替换操作。`CONSUME` 的 reply 复制失败保留 terminal cell。已接受 TX 可能已有不可逆效果；任何错误都不授权自动重放。每个 slot 的 epoch 不回绕，且在消费后保留。"

msgid "Close, trusted reap and role join"
msgstr "Close、可信 reap 与 role join"

msgid "One privileged unmasked Thread serializes gateway and management calls. Identity and copy callbacks may synchronously request close; recursive dispatch and in-flight management reentry reject. Close reserves its control publication, permanently rejects new `SUBMIT` and cancels live work without wiping it or stopping the underlying owner. The external executor must keep servicing actual UART drain. `QUARANTINED` never grants permission to consume or reap."
msgstr "唯一特权、未屏蔽中断的 Thread 串行执行 gateway 和管理调用。Identity 与 copy 回调可以同步请求 close；递归 dispatch 及进行中的管理重入均拒绝。Close 保留其控制发布，永久拒绝新 `SUBMIT`，并取消活动工作，不擦除它或停止底层 owner。外部 executor 必须继续 service 真实 UART 排空。`QUARANTINED` 从不授权 consume 或 reap。"

msgid "If a user mapping disappears permanently, authenticated reply copy may never recover. Trusted management can call `reap`; there is no user wire action for it. It requires permanent close, every retained exact request acquire-observed `SETTLED` and real owner idle. Before any wipe, a trusted `drained` callback must prove outer gateway/transport observers joined and future entries blocked while retaining the exclusive role. Failure or pending/quarantined work preserves all cells and role. Success retires all cells without resetting epochs, wipes copied payloads and latches a local fence against further dispatch. Reap abandons results; it does not cancel an in-flight operation or undo transmitted bytes."
msgstr "如果用户 mapping 永久消失，经过认证的 reply 复制可能永远无法恢复。可信管理可调用 `reap`；不存在对应的用户 wire action。它要求永久 close、每个保留的精确 request 都已 acquire 观察 `SETTLED`，且真实 owner idle。任何擦除前，可信 `drained` 回调必须证明外部 gateway/transport observer 已 join，且未来入口已阻止，同时仍保留独占 role。失败或 pending/quarantined 工作保留全部 cell 与 role。成功后退出全部 cell 而不重置 epoch，擦除已复制 payload，并锁存拒绝后续 dispatch 的本地 fence。Reap 放弃结果；它不取消进行中的操作，也不撤销已发送字节。"

msgid "`join` requires permanent close, every cell consumed or reaped and real owner idle, then the authority's successful release proves outer observers joined and detaches role references. Failed release retains the role and all bound storage. Keep configuration, cells, payloads, owner/provider and every context alive until successful join. Only then may storage be reclaimed or fresh objects claim a larger session. No local epoch or software predicate replaces the external gateway proof or the provider's real final-access proof."
msgstr "`join` 要求永久 close、全部 cell 已消费或 reap，以及真实 owner idle；随后 authority 成功 release 证明外部 observer 已 join，并撤回 role 引用。Release 失败保留 role 与全部绑定存储。配置、cell、payload、owner/provider 和每个 context 都须存活至成功 join。只有此后才能回收存储，或由新对象 claim 更大 session。本地 epoch 或软件谓词不能替代外部 gateway 证明，也不能替代 provider 的真实最后访问证明。"

msgid "Cold validation performs pairwise checks over explicit cells/controls; copies and wiping use the caller's exact byte budgets, and close/reap/join inspect the explicit cell count. These are bounded software costs, not measured MCU latency or power. SVC/CMSE entry, an actual kernel principal/copy/session authority, MPU/TrustZone enforcement, NS RTOS, borrowed-user asynchronous SPI/CAN transports and physical HIL remain outside this increment. The original {download}`IO-39 <io-evolution-execution.csv>` and {download}`SOC-36 <soc-refinement-execution.csv>` exits remain open; this common mechanism does not complete them."
msgstr "Cold 校验对显式 cell/control 执行成对检查；复制与擦除使用调用方精确字节预算，close/reap/join 检查显式 cell 数。这些是有界软件开销，不是 MCU 延迟或功耗测量。SVC/CMSE 入口、实际内核 principal/copy/session authority、MPU/TrustZone 强制、NS RTOS、借用用户内存的异步 SPI/CAN transport 和物理 HIL 仍在本增量之外。原始 {download}`IO-39 <io-evolution-execution.csv>` 与 {download}`SOC-36 <soc-refinement-execution.csv>` 退出仍开放；本公共机制不完成它们。"

msgid "Software validation boundary"
msgstr "软件验证边界"

msgid "Google tests run the actual broker, typed GPIO wrapper, Native GPIO provider, Core request state and Native saved-mask implementation. They model only the external kernel identity/pin/unpin/proof boundary and privileged context. Behavioral RED/GREEN logs, sanitizer runs, public-header probes and strict ARM compilation are recorded in `tools/testing/evidence/user-io-broker-iteration/manifest.json`. These establish software behavior and compilation, not physical isolation, HIL timing or a qualified product release. The optional archive defines no mutable globals; default factory/source/ELF omission is verified separately by the integrating build graph."
msgstr "Google 测试执行真实 broker、类型化 GPIO 包装、Native GPIO 提供者、Core 请求状态与 Native 保存掩码实现，只模拟外部内核身份／pin／unpin／证明边界及特权上下文。行为 RED/GREEN 日志、sanitizer、公共头文件探针与严格 ARM 编译记录在 `tools/testing/evidence/user-io-broker-iteration/manifest.json`。这些证明软件行为和编译，不证明物理隔离、HIL 时序或产品发布资格。可选 archive 无可变全局变量；默认 factory／源码／ELF 的省略由集成构建图另行验证。"

msgid "Copied-UART regressions exercise the real mediation, Core requests and existing BusOwner/UARTOwner with external identity/copy/role and UART hardware ports modeled. They include stale commands across fresh storage/session lifetimes, copy failures, real drain/publication joins, management callback reentry and closed reap. Execution evidence belongs to the exact source records, not to this page or its diagram; it establishes no physical isolation or HIL result."
msgstr "复制 UART 回归执行真实 mediation、Core request 和既有 BusOwner/UARTOwner，仅模拟外部 identity/copy/role 与 UART 硬件端口。它们覆盖跨新存储／session 生命周期的旧命令、复制失败、真实排空／发布 join、管理回调重入和 closed reap。执行证据归属于精确源码记录，不归属于本页或其图；它不建立物理隔离或 HIL 结果。"
